# A whitelist, not a blacklist. This folder holds bank statements and a database
# of every transaction in them; nothing gets into a build context unless it is
# named here, so a new personal file can never be sent to the Docker daemon or
# baked into an image by accident.
*
!finances/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!docker/
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.vite
